c CFON* coloring of the Kneser graph K(5,2) with 1 color(s)
c vertices: the 2-subsets of 1..5 in lexicographic order, numbered from 0
c x(v,c) = variable v*1 + c                 'vertex v has color c'
c u(v,c) = variable 10 + v*1 + c       'v sees color c exactly once'
p cnf 20 50
